        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (f) the following paragraph: u(g) any institution exempted from the provisions of this Act by the Director General.\". Amendment of section 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/25/eng@/~cl_4",
